<title>USA: Griffith San Dist., Ind., won by NatCity.</title>
<headline>Griffith San Dist., Ind., won by NatCity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatCity Investments said it won</p>
<p>$4.855 million of Griffith Sanitary District, Ind., sanitary</p>
<p>district bonds of 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.439 percent.</p>
</text>
